  m_text: "\"On July 30, 16 Russian soldiers escaped from the Nazi camp \u2018Ulmenstok\u2019,
    risking everything to break free.\n\nLed by Major Ryabchikov, their senior officer,
    they reached the thick forest \u2014 but the Nazis are now hunting them down.\n\nThe
    survival of these men depends on YOU, Comrade Ryabchikov! Guide them through
    danger, outsmart the enemy, and bring your soldiers back to the front!\""
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a2ab4710ff3b8024a98e064a99115857, type: 2}
